    <string name="journey_chapter_river">The giant crab scuttles back into its cave, and the river flows calmly again. Chapter 2 is done!</string>
    <string name="journey_chapter_hills">The troll stomps off over the hills, grumbling, and the path is free. Chapter 3 is done!</string>
    <string name="journey_chapter_ruins">The old golem sits down and goes back to sleep. The ruins are quiet. Chapter 4 is done!</string>
    <string name="journey_chapter_castle">The Shadow King runs off into the night, and the sun rises over the castle. Chapter 5 is done: the kingdom is at peace!</string>
