    <string name="journey_boto_says">The Boto, a pink river dolphin, splashes: “Crabs fear plants and frogs fear the cold. Soak them with a wave, then freeze them!” He gives you ethers: +%1$d.</string>
    <string name="journey_caipora_says">The Caipora, friend of the animals, whistles: “Bats hate light, rocklings hate plants. Zeca\'s oil makes fire burn twice as hard!” She gives you ethers: +%1$d.</string>
    <string name="journey_owl_says">A wise old owl hoots: “Ghosts fear the light; empty armors and the golem fear arcane magic. Sleep calms even the strongest.” It gives you ethers: +%1$d.</string>
    <string name="journey_guard_says">An old castle guard whispers: “The Shadow King fears the light. Imps hate the cold, gargoyles hate plants.” He gives you ethers: +%1$d.</string>
